WEBVTT

00:00:00.469 --> 00:00:05.165
Welcome to Alaventra. Rank in
search. Get recommended by AI.

00:00:06.164 --> 00:00:10.364
In tutorial 8.2, you'll read
your AI visibility results,

00:00:10.414 --> 00:00:13.527
and see where AI names you
and who it names instead.

00:00:14.547 --> 00:00:19.707
First, open AI visibility. The top
shows how often AI answers name you,

00:00:19.757 --> 00:00:24.694
your share of voice, how often they link
to your pages, and the visits AI sends you.

00:00:25.718 --> 00:00:29.143
Share of voice is your part of
all the brands the answers name.

00:00:29.193 --> 00:00:32.608
The list shows each competitor's
place next to yours.

00:00:33.557 --> 00:00:37.542
The AI visibility score sums it
up: whether you're named, how high,

00:00:37.592 --> 00:00:38.804
and whether you're linked.

00:00:40.132 --> 00:00:45.742
Next, AI answers change from one ask to
the next, so every rate comes with a range.

00:00:45.792 --> 00:00:48.397
The true figure most
likely sits inside it.

00:00:49.372 --> 00:00:54.167
Further down, a table shows the same
for each assistant: the answers counted,

00:00:54.217 --> 00:00:57.193
how often it names and
cites you, and its range.

00:00:58.156 --> 00:01:01.831
Each figure also shows its
change since the week before.

00:01:01.881 --> 00:01:05.381
Within noise means the change
is too small to call real.

00:01:05.431 --> 00:01:10.181
If the questions or assistants changed,
it says Not compared with the run before,

00:01:10.231 --> 00:01:11.026
and why.

00:01:12.036 --> 00:01:15.731
Now, Questions you lose lists the
questions answered without you,

00:01:15.781 --> 00:01:19.675
who's named instead, and the
sources those answers rely on.

00:01:20.668 --> 00:01:23.844
You also see what the assistant
searched to answer it.

00:01:23.894 --> 00:01:27.118
Write the page opens the page
writer for that question.

00:01:28.165 --> 00:01:30.915
The question grid lists
every tracked question,

00:01:30.965 --> 00:01:33.722
with its rate this week
and who's named instead.

00:01:35.194 --> 00:01:38.368
Then, What to do next ranks
the actions worth most,

00:01:38.418 --> 00:01:41.511
like the answer page to
write or the pitch to send.

00:01:42.694 --> 00:01:47.419
And Sources AI trusts shows the sites
assistants cite for your questions.

00:01:47.469 --> 00:01:50.100
Being mentioned there helps
you get into the answers.

00:01:51.104 --> 00:01:54.479
So you know where AI names you,
who wins the questions you lose,

00:01:54.529 --> 00:01:55.783
and what to do next.

00:01:57.608 --> 00:02:01.908
So, read your score and share of
voice, check the ranges and the change,

00:02:01.958 --> 00:02:05.184
find the questions you lose,
and act on what to do next.

00:02:06.224 --> 00:02:09.324
Now you can read your AI visibility. Next,

00:02:09.374 --> 00:02:13.310
choose the questions buyers
ask AI in tutorial 8.3.
